post.description:
用于以接口动态配置业务回调 URL；不再依赖 app.conf。
<br>字段：
<br>- syncMessageUrl: 同步消息推送地址，支持占位符 {authcode} / {wxid} / {0}
<br>- logoutUrl: 退出登录回调地址，支持占位符 {authcode} / {wxid} / {0}
<br>- eventUrl: 通用业务事件回调地址（可选，支持 {authcode}/{wxid}/{event}/{0}），当未匹配专用字段时回落
<br>推荐：统一使用 {authcode}；例如 http://127.0.0.1:6999/wic/wechat/{authcode}/SyncMessage
<br>示例最简：{"syncMessageUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:6999/wic/wechat/{authcode}/SyncMessage"}
<br>示例常用：{"syncMessageUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:6999/wic/wechat/{authcode}/SyncMessage","logoutUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:6999/wic/wechat/{authcode}/logoutSys"}
<br>curl 示例：
<br>curl -X POST "http://0.0.0.0:8057/api/Webhook/Business/Set?authcode=ac123" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"syncMessageUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:6999/wic/wechat/{authcode}/SyncMessage","logoutUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:6999/wic/wechat/{authcode}/logoutSys"}'
<br>
